---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { localizedPath, ui, type Locale } from '../lib/i18n';
interface Props { locale: Locale; }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const en = locale === 'en';
---
<Layout locale={locale} title={en ? 'About this notebook' : '关于这个博客'}><section class="container page-section about-page"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS NOTEBOOK</span><h1>{en ? 'A record of building.' : '记录构建，'}<br/><em>{en ? 'A space for thinking.' : '也记录思考。'}</em></h1><p>Raymond's Field Notes · {en ? 'A technical blog, just getting started' : '一个正在起步的技术博客'}</p></div><div class="prose">{en ? <><h2>Keep writing simple</h2><p>This notebook is a home for articles about AI, software engineering, and developer tools. Content lives in a Git repository, is written in Markdown, and becomes static pages at build time.</p><p>Articles are published from Markdown. The archive, topics, and search update together with each build.</p><h2>Start with one good note</h2><p>Add a Markdown file with a title, date, summary, and topics, then commit it to Git. The archive, topics, search, RSS, and social cards are generated together. English is the default; the language switch takes you to the same page in Chinese and remembers your choice.</p><h2>Clear technology, clear boundaries</h2><p>This version has no accounts of its own, comments, or database, and it does not collect visitor analytics. Search runs locally in your browser. The site and its source repository are publicly accessible.</p><p>The X sharing link is ready. Public article pages include preview-card metadata and images. Card display and refresh timing depend on platform crawling, caching, and policies.</p></> : <><h2>让写作保持简单</h2><p>这里计划记录 AI、软件工程与开发工具相关的技术文章。内容直接保存在 Git 仓库中，用 Markdown 写作，经过构建生成静态页面。</p><p>文章以 Markdown 编写。每次构建时，文章列表、主题和搜索会随内容一起更新。</p><h2>从一篇文章开始</h2><p>只需要新增一份 Markdown 文件，填写标题、日期、摘要和主题，再提交到 Git。文章列表、主题分类、搜索、RSS 与分享卡片会在构建时一起生成。站点默认英文；语言按钮会保留当前页面，并记住你的选择。</p><h2>开放的技术，清晰的边界</h2><p>此版本不包含自行实现的账号、评论或数据库，也不会收集访问统计。搜索在浏览器本地完成。本站和源码仓库现均可公开访问。</p><p>X 的分享入口已接好，公开文章页包含预览卡片元数据和图片。卡片是否显示及更新时间取决于平台抓取、缓存与规则。</p></>}</div><div class="about-links"><a class="button button-primary" href={site.repository} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><Icon name="github" size={18}/> {en ? 'View the repository' : '查看 GitHub 仓库'}</a><a class="text-link" href={localizedPath('rss.xml', locale)}><Icon name="rss" size={18}/> {ui[locale].rss}</a></div></section></Layout>
